 192:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c **** /**
 193:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   * @brief  Update SystemCoreClock variable according to Clock Register Values.
 194:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *         The SystemCoreClock variable contains the core clock (HCLK), it can
 195:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *         be used by the user application to setup the SysTick timer or configure
 196:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *         other parameters.
 197:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *
 198:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   * @note   Each time the core clock (HCLK) changes, this function must be called
 199:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *         to update SystemCoreClock variable value. Otherwise, any configuration
 200:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *         based on this variable will be incorrect.
 201:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *
 202:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   * @note   - The system frequency computed by this function is not the real
 203:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *           frequency in the chip. It is calculated based on the predefined
 204:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *           constant and the selected clock source:
 205:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *
 206:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *           - If SYSCLK source is HSI, SystemCoreClock will contain the HSI_VALUE(**)
 207:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *
 208:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *           - If SYSCLK source is HSE, SystemCoreClock will contain the HSE_VALUE(***)
 209:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *
 210:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *           - If SYSCLK source is PLL, SystemCoreClock will contain the HSE_VALUE(***)
 211:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *             or HSI_VALUE(*) multiplied/divided by the PLL factors.
 212:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *
 213:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *         (**) HSI_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32g4xx_hal.h file (default value
 214:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *              16 MHz) but the real value may vary depending on the variations
 215:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *              in voltage and temperature.
 216:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *
 217:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *         (***) HSE_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32g4xx_hal.h file (default value
 218:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *              24 MHz), user has to ensure that HSE_VALUE is same as the real
 219:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *              frequency of the crystal used. Otherwise, this function may
 220:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *              have wrong result.
 221:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *
 222:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *         - The result of this function could be not correct when using fractional
 223:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *           value for HSE crystal.
 224:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *
 225:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   * @param  None
 226:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   * @retval None
 227:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   */
 228:/home/peter/FOC/FalconFoc-main/2.Firmware/FalconFoc/Core/Src/system_stm32g4xx.c **** void SystemCoreClockUpdate(void)
